                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i0">
                     <locus from="1r" to="285v">1r-285v</locus>
                     <textLang xml:lang="ar">Arabic</textLang>
                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s38IHA" type="acephalous apodous"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1r">-1r</locus>؟قان لعلكم تهتدون , واذ قال [موسى] لقومه يا قوم انكم ظلمتم انفسكم</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#285v">-285v</locus>وما نرسل المرسلين الا مبشرين ومنذرين ويجادل الذين كفروا بالباطل \ ليد<note>The last word is a catchword.</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>From the middle of verse 2:52 to the middle of verse 18:56. Titles of sūras in red. Red triple circles as verse markers. Black or red ǧuz' markers in the margins. On fol. 70v, the ǧuz' marker in the margin is a black and red sun. Often, the first words of the ǧuz' highlighted in red or written in red. Ṯumn markers in red or black. Additions and corrections in the margins. Folios 108v-109v written in large hand. Less lines on the page on folios 255r-258v. No red markings on folios 174v-229v, 233v-237v and 255r-258v. Corrections and additions in the  margins. Some catchwords.</note>
                     <note/>
                  </msItem>
